  m_text: 'Flying is as easy as you remember.


    Use the ''F'' button to mount
    your broom.


    Use the ''Q'' or Control buttons to descend.


    Use the
    ''E'' or Spacebat buttons to ascend.


    ''W'' ''A'' ''S'' ''D'' are used to
    move the broom.


    Use the mouse to turn.'
